5,0,1,talk,Servas,,Greetings. I am Servas. Wisdom is the light that guides us through the dark.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Minako,,I am Minako. Facts are the foundation of truth. Let us observe carefully.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,George,,"George here. I trust my own eyes. Experience teaches caution, not blind faith.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Asuka,,Asuka. Logic dictates we analyze patterns. Emotions cloud judgment. Stay objective.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Sakura,,Hi everyone! I'm Sakura. I love mysteries! Let's have fun finding the truth together!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Servas,,"Minako, your focus on facts is admirable. Trust is built on consistent actions.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Minako,,"Agreed, Servas. Consistency reveals character. I will rely on data to guide us.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,George,,I prefer to stand alone. Relying on others is a weakness I do not share.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"George, isolation is inefficient. Collaboration yields better data. Consider the group.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"George, don't be so serious! We're a team! I'll keep the mood light!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Servas,,Asuka is right. We are a community. Let us support one another's insights.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Minako,,"Support is useful, but verification is essential. I will verify all claims.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,George,,Verification is good. But I will verify myself. Do not expect me to follow.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"Independence is fine, but cross-referencing prevents errors. I will note your stance.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"I'll watch everyone closely! If someone acts weird, I'll tell you!","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Servas,,A good start. Let us proceed with calm and clarity. Peace be with us.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Minako,,Calmness is key. I will remain steady. Let the night reveal the first clues.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,George,,I will observe. Silence is often louder than words. Goodnight.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Asuka,,Agreed. Data collection begins now. I will analyze the night's events.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Sakura,,Goodnight! I hope we catch the wolf! Bye bye!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
